      "content": "Consider the hydrated ions of Ti<sup>2+</sup>, V<sup>2+</sup>, Ti<sup>3+</sup>, and Sc<sup>3+</sup>. The correct order of their spin-only magnetic\nmoments is : ",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "Sc<sup>3+</sup> &lt; Ti<sup>3+</sup> &lt; V<sup>2+</sup> &lt; Ti<sup>2+</sup>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "Sc<sup>3+</sup> &lt; Ti<sup>3+</sup> &lt; Ti<sup>2+</sup> &lt; V<sup>2+</sup> "
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "Ti<sup>3+</sup> &lt; Ti<sup>2+</sup> &lt;  Sc<sup>3+</sup> &lt; V<sup>2+</sup> "
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "V<sup>2+</sup> &lt; Ti<sup>2+</sup> &lt; Ti<sup>3+</sup> &lt;  Sc<sup>3+</sup>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "B"
      ],
